From 565e4c226d3d017d03c4f8163da2aac9a437bd76 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: slaier <slaier@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 07:55:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(tts-server): add idle sleep and lazy model loading

Adds the `--sleep-idle-seconds` command-line option to automatically
unload the TTS model after a period of inactivity to free VRAM, and
reload it lazily on demand.
